exercises.prompt:
A status screen must show exactly one wound label per hero. A teammate used three separate if statements:

  if health > 50: print("healthy")
  if health > 0: print("wounded")
  if health <= 0: print("critical")

At health 80, both healthy and wounded would print. Which structure guarantees only one message?
